{"claims":[{"excerpt":"## Welk aandeel van de energie was hernieuwbaar in 2024?\n\nDat hangt af van wat je meet.","claim":"The question concerns the global renewable-energy share in 2024, and the answer varies depending on the measure used.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"# EIA world renewable energy statistics\n\nThe table for 2024 lists","narrative":"De vraag welk deel van de energie wereldwijd hernieuwbaar is, heeft in 2024 niet één antwoord: het hangt af van wat je meet.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source provides distinct 2024 shares for electricity production, total energy production, and total energy consumption; the upstream synthesis also frames the answer as depending on what is measured.","materiality":"Material framing of the article's subject, accurately reflecting the source's different measures."},{"excerpt":"Hernieuwbare bronnen leverden wereldwijd 32% van de elektriciteit.","claim":"Renewable sources accounted for 32% of worldwide electricity production in 2024.","category":"quantity","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The table for 2024 lists 10.0 trillion kWh of renewable electricity production out of 30.7 trillion kWh of total electricity production, reported as 32%.","narrative":"Hernieuwbare bronnen leverden 32% van de elektriciteit","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source reports 32% for renewable electricity production. The following sentence in the piece explicitly identifies production as the relevant measure.","materiality":"Material statistic; the production measure is made clear in the piece."},{"excerpt":"Van de totale energieproductie was 7% hernieuwbaar;","claim":"Renewables accounted for 7% of total energy production in 2024.","category":"quantity","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"Across all energy production, renewables were 42.4 out of 605.6 quadrillion Btu, reported as 7%.","narrative":"hernieuwbare energie 7% uitmaakte van zowel de totale energieproductie","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source reports the renewable share of all energy production as 7%.","materiality":"Material statistic."},{"excerpt":"ook in het totale energieverbruik bedroeg het aandeel 7%.","claim":"Renewables accounted for 7% of total energy consumption in 2024.","category":"quantity","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The renewable share of all energy consumption was also 7%.","narrative":"hernieuwbare energie 7% uitmaakte van zowel de totale energieproductie als het totale energieverbruik.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source explicitly reports a 7% renewable share of all energy consumption.","materiality":"Material statistic."},{"excerpt":"De percentages hebben dus betrekking op verschillende maatstaven.","claim":"The stated percentages refer to different measures.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The table for 2024 lists 10.0 trillion kWh of renewable electricity production out of 30.7 trillion kWh of total electricity production, reported as 32%. Across all energy production, renewables were 42.4 out of 605.6 quadrillion Btu, reported as 7%. The renewable share of all energy consumption was also 7%.","narrative":"De lezer moet begrijpen dat een percentage voor elektriciteit niet hetzelfde is als een percentage voor alle energie.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source gives separate shares for electricity production, all energy production, and all energy consumption.","materiality":"Material distinction needed to interpret the percentages correctly."},{"excerpt":"Het aandeel van 32% geldt alleen voor elektriciteitsproductie, niet voor alle energieproductie of het totale energieverbruik.","claim":"The 32% figure applies to electricity production, not to total energy production or total energy consumption.","category":"scope","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The table for 2024 lists 10.0 trillion kWh of renewable electricity production out of 30.7 trillion kWh of total electricity production, reported as 32%. Across all energy production, renewables were 42.4 out of 605.6 quadrillion Btu, reported as 7%. The renewable share of all energy consumption was also 7%.","narrative":"De lezer moet begrijpen dat een percentage voor elektriciteit niet hetzelfde is als een percentage voor alle energie.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source distinguishes the 32% electricity-production figure from the 7% figures for all energy production and consumption.","materiality":"Material scope clarification that prevents applying 32% to all energy."},{"excerpt":"De cijfers zijn gebaseerd op de gegevensversie van 1 juli 2026 en kunnen worden bijgewerkt.","claim":"The figures use a July 1, 2026 data vintage and may be updated.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"This is a July 1, 2026 data vintage subject to change.","narrative":"De cijfers zijn voor 2024 en horen bij een gegevensversie van 1 juli 2026, die kan worden bijgewerkt.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source identifies the data vintage as July 1, 2026 and says it is subject to change.","materiality":"Material qualification of the data's version and currency."}]}

